# Force LF line endings on checkout for all text files regardless of the
# checking-out machine's git core.autocrlf setting. This keeps CI (Windows
# runners) and local Windows dev checkouts byte-identical, which several
# validate-*.cjs contract scripts rely on via literal \n regex matching.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.blockmap binary
*.pen binary
